        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Princess Maker 3 is the third mainline Princess Maker game. The game was originally released in 1997 and 1998 on PlayStation, Sega Saturn, Dreamcast (later rereleased in 2001 as part of Princess Maker Collection where it was bundled with Princess Maker 2) and Windows. In 2017 the game was released on Steam and Nintendo Switch as Princess Maker ~Faery Tales Come True~ (HD Remake), featuring upscaled graphics, a new UI (as well as the old UI) and more.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Princess Maker 3 es la tercera entrega principal de la serie Princess Maker. El juego salió originalmente en 1997 y 1998 para PlayStation, Sega Saturn, Dreamcast (reeditado en 2001 como parte de Princess Maker Collection, junto con Princess Maker 2) y Windows. En 2017 se lanzó en Steam y Nintendo Switch como Princess Maker ~Faery Tales Come True~ (remake en HD), con gráficos escalados, una nueva interfaz (además de la antigua) y más.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
