        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Princess Maker Refine revisits the classic first installment of the Princess Maker series, a mainstay of the simulation gaming genre with a long-lasting and dedicated fan base. Princess Maker combines simulation gaming with an interesting, in-depth story as it follows the tale of a young girl adopted by a warrior and raised to become a lady.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Princess Maker Refine revisita la clásica primera entrega de la serie Princess Maker, un referente del género de simulación con una base de fans longeva y fiel. Princess Maker combina la simulación con una historia interesante y profunda que sigue la trayectoria de una joven adoptada por un guerrero y criada para convertirse en una dama.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
